flowchart LR
    SOURCE[Private GitHub repository] --> MANUAL[Manual Actions dispatch on main]
    MANUAL --> CHECK[TypeScript application desktop browser checks]
    CHECK --> MIGRATE[Apply reviewed Supabase SQL migrations]
    MIGRATE --> FUNC[Deploy Edge API and provider secrets]
    FUNC --> ASSETS[Stage Vercel production build without domain]
    ASSETS --> ROUTES[Check deployed app routes]
    ROUTES --> CF[Promote checked build to production domain]
    CHECK --> NATIVE[Manual tagged Windows installer release]
    NATIVE --> INSTALL[NSIS installer and SHA256 on GitHub]
    FUNC --> SB[Supabase Auth DB and private Storage]
    CF --> SMOKE[Login upload review dual approval export smoke test]
    SB --> SMOKE
    SMOKE --> PILOT[Invite pilot employees]
